                                                "sense_id": "b41772d4-7701-32fc-8587-f7efc3f33add",
                                                "text": "to blur a photograph (by moving the camera while taking it)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "736b2f5c-b6d3-373f-8d59-679b3a994437",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To smear, stain or smudge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6dba246-98e5-4a4e-bf4c-0a558c1310a3",
                                                "sense_id": "736b2f5c-b6d3-373f-8d59-679b3a994437",
                                                "text": "to blur a manuscript (by handling it while damp)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2b33da0-6c4a-3c61-ba6c-c91ee7d7103c",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become indistinct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76f37c5f-d08c-38fd-b547-4cd502ca8fa9",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause imperfection of vision in; to dim; to darken."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f56c316-724f-4b27-aae8-ba1107beb881",
                                                "sense_id": "76f37c5f-d08c-38fd-b547-4cd502ca8fa9",
                                                "text": "His eyes are blurred with the lightning's glare."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "866d5aca-9bd0-3aa9-9173-6b991b7f499e",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sully; to stain; to blemish, as reputation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "596199b0-3a5b-414e-877a-9e434325a161",
                                                "sense_id": "866d5aca-9bd0-3aa9-9173-6b991b7f499e",
                                                "text": "Sarcasms may eclipse thine own, / But cannot blur my lost renown."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd3d83f9-c65c-32a5-ad7c-bbcf8e560fda",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To transfer the input focus away from."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9de9695a-ff94-4d5a-985d-f4066036e57e",
                                                "sense_id": "fd3d83f9-c65c-32a5-ad7c-bbcf8e560fda",
                                                "text": "Then give this box focus to blur the first one: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1775ef5-9918-40ee-8040-b7e322b80a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "fd3d83f9-c65c-32a5-ad7c-bbcf8e560fda",
                                                "text": "These form elements need to have an onFocus event handler to blur the current focus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91c4b0e5-ae10-482a-b121-707421e8a6fe",
                                                "sense_id": "fd3d83f9-c65c-32a5-ad7c-bbcf8e560fda",
                                                "text": "Blurring one window and focusing on another window yields the same result of sending the window to the back of the pile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf9402d0-fb4c-4280-bac8-1489ddd0f02d",
                                                "sense_id": "fd3d83f9-c65c-32a5-ad7c-bbcf8e560fda",
                                                "text": "A manual way to blur a text object is to press the Tab key, which advances focus to the next field in order and removes it from the current field (blurring it)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73ac0eff-e5ca-3b11-9736-899c858d170d",
                                        "entry_id": "126be315-f525-3af5-8cc8-c68c69879f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use a sign, image, expression, etc. sufficiently close to a trademarked one that it causes confusion between them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
